# PC card team-counters (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 11, TMODE-20..24, BENCH-123): screen s1, each team's first counter, against master (the aa build) on its own teams. Template: tcprep writes work/team-counters-s1.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
4600
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-counters-s1.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@ka.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@ka
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-counters-@V@-s1
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-counters-s1.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
